// DPI-awareness (PerMonitorV2) + supportedOS manifest for sciqlop-launcher.exe.
// Without this, WACK's DPIAwarenessValidation flags the launcher as DPI-unaware.
// Moved here from scripts/windows/launcher.rc — that copy compiled the old
// standalone launcher.c; this one is wired into the sciqlop-launcher CMake
// target instead (see launcher/CMakeLists.txt's if(WIN32) block).
#include <winuser.h>

1 RT_MANIFEST "launcher.exe.manifest"
